# Bioluminescent jellyfish. Tentacles (t, u) are drawn after the outline so they stay 1px thin.
@sprite jelly
@outline ink
@thin tu
@map B=vio3 h=pearl b=vio2 t=vio3 u=glow

@frame pulse0
..BBB..
.BhBBB.
BhBBBBB
BBBBBBB
bbbbbbb
.t.u.t.
.t.u.t.
t..u..t
t.u..t.
..u..t.

@frame pulse1
.......
..BBB..
.BhBBB.
BBBBBBB
.bbbbb.
.t.u.t.
t..u..t
t.u...t
.tu..t.
..u.t..
